                           Runtime Filter: karr
                     ->  Hash
                           ->  Broadcast Motion 3:3  (slice2; segments: 3)
                                 ->  Seq Scan on rf_dim_arr d
                                       Filter: (flag = 3)
 Optimizer: GPORCA
